  "acerca": [
    [
      "p",
      "For those looking to get a little more out of Baldur’s Gate 3, the Digital Deluxe Edition upgrade content includes in-game cosmetics, such as a unique custom dice skin to show off to your friends, as well as practical in-game items such as the Mask of the Shapeshifter from Divinity: Original Sin 2."
    ],
    [
      "p",
      "Listen to the magical music of Borislav Slavov’s Original Soundtrack for Baldur’s Gate 3 or even pick up a pen and play D&D as one of our Origin characters with the handy printable pre-made character sheets. There’s plenty to get stuck into, in and outside of the game."
    ],
    [
      "p",
      "For full details, see below."
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Bard Song Pack - Astound audiences by performing this special set of new songs – or have them covering their ears if you lack proficiency."
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Exclusive Dice Skin - Fail checks with style, or succeed with a new air of confidence."
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Paintings from Rivellon - Discover a new collection of paintings across the Forgotten Realms, inspired by Divinity: Original Sin 2."
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Adventurer's Pouch - Receive a collection of camp supplies and potions to help get your journey started."
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Digital OST - Enjoy the music of Baldur's Gate 3 from composer Borislav Slavov. Crack this soundtrack out in your D&D session, and get the feel and mood of Baldur's Gate 3!"
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Digital Artbook - Explore the art and design of Baldur's Gate 3 in this comprehensive digital artbook, written by Larian."
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Digital Character Sheets - Peruse and print a set of four-page D&D character sheets for each Baldur's Gate 3 Origin character."
    ],
    [
      "p",
      "AND AN ITEM PACK FROM THE WORLD OF DIVINITY: ORIGINAL SIN!"
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Mask of the Shapeshifter - Headgear that allows you to change race and appearance on the fly, inspired by Fane of Divinity: Original Sin 2"
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Cape of the Red Prince - Cloak inspired by the Red Prince of Divinity: Original Sin 2"
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Lute of the Merryweather Bard - Playable instrument inspired by Lohse of Divinity: Original Sin 2"
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Needle of the Outlaw Rogue - Dagger inspired by Sebille of Divinity: Original Sin 2"
    ],
    [
      "li",
      "Bicorne of the Sea Beast - Headgear inspired by Beast of Divinity: Original Sin 2"
    ],
    [
      "p",
      "All as awesome as they are wholly unnecessary."
    ]
